      "created_at": "2016-02-19T15:27:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>With Rod of Anubis in Mr. Fixer's play area, Mr. Fixer plays Overdrive, which allows Mr. Fixer to use his 'Strike' power twice this turn. Then, in the power phase, Mr. Fixer used the Rod of Anubis. Afterwards, he can still use 'Strike' twice!&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yup! I remember this being mentioned at some point a while ago, before the video game came out. He rocks with Captain Cosmic, too.</p>",
